{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415035","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415035","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041503501:1":{"text":"うん、野菜とハーブの基本は完璧です。特別な木の実についても学びましたし……","source_cn":"嗯，蔬菜和草药你基本都认识，特殊的果实你也学过了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9614CCAA58EE41D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503502:1":{"text":"そうだ！雨が止んだら、キノコ狩りに出かけましょう！","source_cn":"那么等这场雨下完，我们就出去采蘑菇吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9010E2D35A7F3711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503503:1":{"text":"キノコ？確か菌類は素晴らしい食材になると……","source_cn":"蘑菇？菌类的确是很好的食材……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1B6D2D5C4F80A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503504:1":{"text":"その通り！特にダウナエおばあさまのキノコスープは絶品で、一杯の鍋だって一人で飲み干せてしまいますよ！","source_cn":"对吧！达赫妮婆婆的蘑菇汤棒极了，我一个人能喝一锅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE62357F5EF5A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503505:1":{"text":"実はもう、ここに来る途中でいくつか採ってきたの。","source_cn":"来的路上我已经采了一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FB1C7DA0F773D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503506:1":{"text":"赤いのとか、オレンジのとか。これは白い斑点がかわいくて、この光ってるのは……","source_cn":"红色的，橘黄色的，这种带着白点的很可爱，还有会发光的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74042BE688FAB5D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503507:1":{"text":"それは絶対に食べちゃダメェェェェ！","source_cn":"不不不不，不不不不不，不不不不！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x372EB540EF4D5CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:五月":{"text":"メイ","source":"五月","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}